OL,3,ASpecialist courts for rape cases to be
OL,4,Arolled out in England and Wales
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpecialist courts to handle cases of
OL,7,Frape and other sexual offences will be
OL,8,Fintroduced across England and Wales
OL,9,Fover the next two years, the prime
OL,10,Fminister has announced.
OL,12,FEach crown court will have at least one
OL,13,Fcourtroom set up to hear such cases,
OL,14,Fwhile alleged victims will be able to
OL,15,Fview proceedings remotely and give
OL,16,Fevidence from a separate room via video
OL,17,Flink.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,0,100
