OL,3,ASpecialist courts for rape cases to be
OL,4,Arolled out in England and Wales
OL,5,
OL,6,FThey will also be provided with private
OL,7,Fentrances and waiting rooms to separate
OL,8,Fthem from defendants, though this will
OL,9,Fbe dependent on the architecture of
OL,10,Feach building.
OL,12,FRape Crisis England and Wales said this
OL,13,Fwas a "significant step forward" that
OL,14,Fwould introduce several reforms it had
OL,15,Fbeen requesting for years.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
